   402	   *     DVP bus could plausibly explain line-done interrupts never
   403	   *     firing even with power/clock/soft-reset all correct.
   404	   *   - sync_edge_dect_en (bit[9]) defaults to 0 = disabled, but the
   405	   *     reference always enables it; with edge detection disabled the
   406	   *     module may never notice HSYNC/VSYNC transitions at all, which
   407	   *     would also fully explain zero interrupts.
